From 820155946f7c49be423d3dc3fa05ef16032e8107 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mrinohk <5554998+Mrinohk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 11:30:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05/31] cuda : skip the gated_delta_net state gather, read the
 cache row

With one sequence the GET_ROWS that copies the recurrent state out of the
cache is skipped and the gdn reads cache row ids[seq] directly. Each block
reads its slice of the state before it writes it, so this is bit-exact.
GGML_CUDA_P60_GDN_STATE=0 disables it.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/common.cuh         | 12 ++++++
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/gated_delta_net.cu | 37 +++++++++++------
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu       | 57 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

